{"h":3390,"w":2400,"lines":[{"y":0.045058139492761828,"w":0.065708414713541663,"t":"Test 2","h":0.016003807315432494,"x":0.086242302294153195,"c":1},{"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","y":0.092920354182138287,"w":0.31006159464518224,"h":0.016224188790560534,"x":0.088295691204102938,"c":1},{"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","w":0.82775268554687498,"h":0.021810305435045696,"c":1,"x":0.088173697950276159,"y":0.12904851986675014},{"c":1,"h":0.016050970589516766,"t":"Passage 3 below.","x":0.086242298709857487,"y":0.14825581405697486,"w":0.17043121337890621},{"h":0.033463861246024629,"x":0.14566908505650389,"t":"An inquiry into the existence of the","c":1,"w":0.72506896972656243,"y":0.1772628702539274},{"h":0.034564715360118181,"c":1,"y":0.21818275857538638,"t":"gifted child","w":0.2347642262776693,"x":0.38775135695920776},{"h":0.019286307050766949,"t":"Let us start by looking at a modern 'genius","y":0.26569786204934442,"c":1,"x":0.086091149622948629,"w":0.40071502685546878},{"c":1,"w":0.3757700093587239,"h":0.016001234926656949,"y":0.28488372104121962,"x":0.086242305224755234,"t":"Maryam Mirzakhani, who died at the early"},{"y":0.30087209283140193,"t":"age of 40. She was the only woman to win the","h":0.017441860412777732,"c":1,"w":0.41067761739095054,"x":0.084188908193641887},{"y":0.31599956328583845,"h":0.022385971384414227,"t":"Fields Medal - the mathematical equivalent","c":1,"x":0.083940109742657823,"w":0.38866216023763028},{"w":0.39459935506184896,"y":0.33557626955553121,"h":0.019614448659891148,"c":1,"t":"of a Nobel prize. It would be easy to assume","x":0.084021858046474066},{"t":"that someone as special as Mirzakhani must","c":1,"x":0.084188917477063724,"y":0.35457227124670188,"w":0.38809033711751295,"h":0.016067263510374907},{"y":0.36905052386490433,"t":"have been one of those 'gifted' children,","w":0.35795511881510417,"x":0.083888189897895135,"h":0.020620592505531055,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.38826904296875003,"y":0.38938208825146226,"t":"those who have an extraordinary ability in a","h":0.019030896752281534,"x":0.084104852360685337},{"h":0.019738758278455615,"y":0.40591134444592036,"t":"specific sphere of activity or knowledge. But","x":0.08403227441339732,"w":0.39661493937174475,"c":1},{"h":0.019327281850629152,"x":0.083855184813014835,"y":0.42366203317557383,"t":"look closer and a different story emerges.","w":0.36616182963053379,"c":1},{"x":0.083896098242189271,"t":"Mirzakhani was born in Tehran, Iran. She","y":0.43987539379604512,"w":0.36810503641764325,"h":0.021821067607508238,"c":1},{"h":0.015988371857499684,"y":0.46075581406274568,"x":0.084188910761748073,"t":"went to a highly selective girls' school but","w":0.37371663411458333,"c":1},{"t":"maths wasn't her interest - reading was. She","y":0.47611659805942974,"w":0.39248873392740885,"h":0.018615832933634002,"x":0.084059998780503145,"c":1},{"x":0.081887150081719165,"y":0.49288886921348318,"w":0.37418800354003906,"h":0.019758555319457027,"c":1,"t":"loved novels and would read anything she"},{"h":0.020606912483507878,"c":1,"y":0.5112132999308554,"w":0.396709238688151,"t":"could lay her hands on. As for maths, she did","x":0.083978832059218009},{"c":1,"w":0.40064534505208338,"h":0.01886413709252277,"t":"rather poorly at it for the first couple of years","y":0.52934641068347077,"x":0.082022836785079059},{"c":1,"y":0.54701346239389304,"t":"in her middle school, but became interested","x":0.081967822922454914,"w":0.38633168538411461,"h":0.018238718038463331},{"h":0.016665115468973313,"t":"when her elder brother told her about what","x":0.084049354857403197,"y":0.56441953523244071,"c":1,"w":0.37812032063802081},{"x":0.081859964436882676,"w":0.35578651428222652,"c":1,"y":0.58097783669779846,"t":"he'd learned. He shared a famous maths","h":0.019758313384379611},{"x":0.084188913751206559,"y":0.6002906976322967,"t":"problem from a magazine that fascinated","w":0.35934290568033855,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1},{"t":"her - and she was hooked.","c":1,"w":0.23663063049316405,"x":0.081909085801704223,"y":0.61696890843193075,"h":0.016863810558937931},{"x":0.081912501728881898,"w":0.37215779622395828,"h":0.019001902802503912,"c":1,"t":"In adult life it is clear that she was curious,","y":0.65116322687813855},{"h":0.017505964206031677,"w":0.37598742167154953,"y":0.66987433528435048,"c":1,"x":0.082034685037007518,"t":"excited by what she did and also resolute in"},{"x":0.081952287119422443,"t":"the face of setbacks. One of her comments","w":0.36587900797526041,"y":0.6880782894987254,"h":0.017217090347875219,"c":1},{"h":0.022401000616473099,"w":0.36820205688476559,"x":0.081837746240914694,"t":"sums it up. 'Of course, the most rewarding","y":0.70361536203335995,"c":1},{"w":0.38452405293782554,"c":1,"h":0.022733378902649037,"y":0.72056600759677458,"x":0.081880649546625883,"t":"part is the \"Aha\" moment, the excitement of"},{"h":0.01881407397334911,"c":1,"w":0.36798917134602865,"t":"discovery and enjoyment of understanding","y":0.7400681571458233,"x":0.081927413598901447},{"x":0.082135523732021529,"c":1,"y":0.75870206494350345,"w":0.40657084147135414,"h":0.017460725722411419,"t":"something new... But most of the time, doing"},{"y":0.77481574697994371,"h":0.01921216126388503,"c":1,"x":0.081960211120985532,"w":0.41305244445800782,"t":"mathematics for me is like being on a long hike"},{"y":0.79113874032572207,"c":1,"h":0.021291927461427163,"x":0.081915698130904768,"t":"with no trail and no end in sight.' That trail","w":0.37005765279134112},{"w":0.36755645751953125,"x":0.0800821407549797,"y":0.81238938064383093,"t":"took her to the heights of original research","c":1,"h":0.016224188790560423},{"x":0.081732562293451619,"t":"into mathematics.","c":1,"y":0.82736447022047677,"h":0.015822431963805172,"w":0.15695945739746092},{"h":0.018486314396590986,"w":0.38019488016764319,"c":1,"t":"Is her background unusual? Apparently not.","x":0.07992134191086829,"y":0.86300883146522933},{"y":0.88226744206601448,"x":0.084188911419408985,"c":1,"h":0.014534883302221635,"t":"Most Nobel prize winners were unexceptional","w":0.39425051371256509},{"h":0.013081394746943587,"x":0.080082136260969605,"y":0.92005813978132478,"t":"48","w":0.026694043477376306,"c":1},{"w":0.37371663411458333,"h":0.014585476990646384,"y":0.26889534903821022,"x":0.51129363345133494,"t":"in childhood. Einstein was slow to talk as a","c":1},{"w":0.41067761739095054,"x":0.51334702274680277,"t":"baby. He failed the general part of the entry test","y":0.28633720932077722,"h":0.017497598878753573,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.019786647920411626,"t":"to Zurich Polytechnic - though they let him in","x":0.5070085357513654,"y":0.3024842930265268,"w":0.40485720316569007},{"w":0.36344968159993496,"t":"because of high physics and maths scores.","y":0.32122093034153509,"h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1,"x":0.51334702758575357},{"t":"He struggled at work initially, but he kept","x":0.51540040912808882,"y":0.3386430680340925,"w":0.35728953043619782,"c":1,"h":0.016008094630058589},{"y":0.35604719768887161,"w":0.36139630635579423,"h":0.016045825249325962,"c":1,"x":0.5133470170479757,"t":"plugging away and eventually rewrote the"},{"t":"laws of Newtonian mechanics with his theory","w":0.390589599609375,"y":0.37252919473686141,"h":0.018555885922592386,"x":0.51311991145281066,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.39057657480333985,"w":0.10993030548095706,"t":"of relativity.","x":0.51291744184914068,"h":0.017495958221345531},{"c":1,"w":0.35523612976074215,"x":0.51334702741942351,"y":0.4273255816004532,"t":"There has been a considerable amount of","h":0.014562323803747002},{"t":"research on high performance over the last","x":0.51129363321493737,"w":0.36960985819498693,"c":1,"y":0.44476744195772899,"h":0.015999519438166798},{"w":0.40657084147135414,"x":0.51334702228280338,"h":0.015988371857499573,"t":"century that suggests it goes way beyond tested","c":1,"y":0.46220930224348855},{"y":0.47964601746749613,"t":"intelligence. On top of that, research is clear","x":0.51129363372364156,"w":0.38193018595377604,"h":0.017447005752968647,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.49565768879674832,"h":0.020560216763026662,"x":0.51309969842681857,"t":"that brains are flexible, new neural pathways","w":0.3844238789876302},{"h":0.018119797945725824,"x":0.51117861791769215,"t":"can be created, and IQ isn't fixed. For example,","y":0.51392146237907943,"w":0.41094383239746102,"c":1},{"h":0.01761916337815006,"t":"Just because you can read stories with hundreds","c":1,"w":0.41090278625488275,"x":0.50913315030925155,"y":0.53097309956211192},{"x":0.51322871424714345,"t":"of pages at the age of five doesn't mean you","c":1,"y":0.54813408023984833,"w":0.37601687113444027,"h":0.018885672690242439},{"c":1,"h":0.017505316607720034,"x":0.51334702147161648,"t":"will still be ahead of your contemporaries in","y":0.56686046496802966,"w":0.37782341003417974},{"t":"your teens.","y":0.58683611662844248,"w":0.0987548828125,"c":1,"x":0.51119750714945178,"h":0.013827766711029699},{"c":1,"t":"While the jury is out on giftedness being","y":0.62063953499615321,"x":0.51334702714531699,"h":0.015988371857499684,"w":0.34702257792154945},{"c":1,"y":0.63611640471280961,"w":0.36994010925292975,"t":"innate and other factors potentially making","h":0.018871815999348951,"x":0.51112621261726243},{"w":0.34291580200195304,"h":0.016054400441217531,"x":0.5112936389093482,"t":"the difference, what is certain is that the","y":0.65545722734175205,"c":1},{"c":1,"t":"behaviours associated with high levels of","x":0.50924024494676545,"y":0.67286135718922546,"w":0.35728953043619793,"h":0.016224188790560423},{"h":0.016224188790560423,"x":0.51129363352450163,"t":"performance are replicable and most can be","y":0.6902654864702229,"w":0.37371663411458333,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.018652866442295024,"x":0.51113959003763054,"y":0.70674785475977064,"t":"taught - even traits such as curiosity.","w":0.31859382629394539},{"y":0.74267030475038476,"h":0.017245362993538516,"x":0.51119586500765801,"t":"According to my colleague Prof Deborah","w":0.35543446858723959,"c":1},{"x":0.51129363292383523,"y":0.760174418712664,"w":0.35728953043619804,"t":"Eyre, with whom I've collaborated on the","h":0.015988371857499684,"c":1},{"h":0.022873392920930158,"y":0.77382704684135706,"x":0.51092991685062406,"t":"book Great Minds and How to Grow Them,","c":1,"w":0.37660804748535159},{"c":1,"t":"the latest neuroscience and psychological","y":0.79646017686839232,"h":0.016039823008849541,"x":0.51129363932201599,"w":0.35523612976074215},{"x":0.50924024584430427,"t":"research suggests most individuals can reach","y":0.81386430680428279,"w":0.38603696187337222,"c":1,"h":0.014749262536873142},{"h":0.014749262536873142,"c":1,"t":"levels of performance associated in school with","y":0.83126843665285399,"x":0.50924024021644698,"w":0.40862424214680992},{"h":0.020076422002111571,"w":0.3740699513753255,"c":1,"t":"the gifted and talented. However, they must","x":0.51110676657591003,"y":0.84684066076820752},{"h":0.016021815162141073,"c":1,"t":"be taught the right attitudes and approaches","x":0.51129363981209131,"y":0.86627906987910119,"w":0.37166323343912755},{"w":0.39014373779296874,"h":0.015988371857499573,"c":1,"t":"to their learning and develop the attributes of","y":0.88372093034577781,"x":0.50924024599874618},{"w":0.45882354736328124,"x":0.51176469619230891,"y":0.94166666659226195,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1}]}